## The resource shape

Every resource has the same shape as the matching Reis YAML file and the console's YAML view: the same friendly names (`cpu`, `max_replicas`, `tls_bundles`) and the same sections (`workload`, `scaling`, `security`). A Reis file and the equivalent Terraform resource line up key for key, so you can move between them without translating.

## Upgrading from 0.x

Version 1.0 renames attributes and groups them into sections. Existing state upgrades automatically on the first plan, but configurations must be rewritten. See [Upgrading to version 1](guides/upgrading-to-v1).

